  Source pin: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Author:
  parent session <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>; independent
  review by <verbatim|/root/independent_review> (gpt-6-astra), recorded
  separately. Status: draft.

  Authoritative prose: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/phases.tex> and
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/phase-selection.tex>. These extend the
  reflection chapter; they do not discharge the Wilson construction's slab
  bounds or full covariance.

  <section|Correspondence><label|correspondence>

